<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Acorn coverage.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Acorn coverage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acorn Group Plc was rated &quot;venture-outperform&quot; as Lehman Brothers started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>In a research note, analyst Chris Heminway at Lehman said Acorn offers exposure to the exploding market for internet-related products, though the market was highly competitive and crowded.</p>
<p>&quot;We see tremendous potential but also significant risks,&quot; Heminway said.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
